    "text": "// A configuration file as written by hand.\n{\n  /* The pipeline. */\n  \"PipelineOptions\": {\n    \"Elements\": [\n      { \"BuilderName\": \"SequenceElementBuilder\", }, // A trailing comma.\n      {\n        \"BuilderName\": \"DeviceDetectionHashEngineBuilder\",\n        \"BuildParameters\": {\n          \"Data\\u0046ile\": \"{dd}\",\n          \"CreateTempDataCopy\": \"false\",\n          \"AutoUpdate\": \"false\",\n          \"DataFileSystemWatcher\": \"false\",\n          \"DataUpdateOnStartup\": \"false\",\n        },\n      },\n      { \"BuilderName\": \"JsonBuilderElementBuilder\" },\n      {\n        \"BuilderName\": \"ShareUsageBuilder\",\n        \"BuildParameters\": {\n          \"SharePercentage\": 2.5e-05, // A fraction with an exponent.\n          \"MinimumEntriesPerMessage\": 20,\n        },\n      },\n    ],\n    \"BuildParameters\": {\n      /* Process errors are not suppressed. */\n      \"SuppressProcessExceptions\": \"false\",\n    },\n  },\n}\n"
